        <h2>Where to Buy</h2>
        <p>
          All three chairs are available new through manufacturer websites, authorized dealers,
          and Amazon. Certified refurbished options are a legitimate path, particularly for the
          Aeron and Leap Plus, where the used market is well-established and quality refurbishers
          offer meaningful warranties.
        </p>
